      "flags": {},
      "order": 25,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 Eros Max Pro I2V – the original base workflow remains separate.\n\n1. Choose a start image. Center crop preserves proportions but may trim the edges.\n2. Set only Width and Height (multiples of 32). Default: 768 × 1344.\n3. For an end frame, choose a second image and turn ON the end-image switch. When OFF, only the start image is used.\n4. Eight seconds at 24 FPS gives 192 frames.\n5. To compare quality, keep the seed fixed and try 6 versus 8 steps.\n6. Middle frame: enable it in group 04 and choose an image. Frame 96 is about 4 seconds.\n7. Run any 1080p upscale separately as post-processing."
      ],
      "color": "#29444d",
      "bgcolor": "#22343a"
    },
