      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "OFF by default: the middle image is not used and adds no work.\n\nON: choose an image you want to see near the middle of the video. At 8 s / 24 FPS, frame_idx = 96 is about 4 seconds.\n\nIf you change the duration, update frame_idx too. Very different start, middle, and end images can create unnatural transitions."
      ],
      "color": "#29444d",
      "bgcolor": "#22343a"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "Prophetero · H3 Pro [EN]",
      "pos": [
        40,
        65
      ],
      "size": [
        660,
        270
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 31,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Image-to-video · Power LoRA · live preview\n\nNo text or watermark is added to the video. Prophetero is only the workflow name.\n\nDefault: 768 × 1344 · 8 seconds · 24 FPS · 192 frames · 6 steps."
      ],
      "color": "#214355",
      "bgcolor": "#172b35"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "LIVE STATUS · CPU / GPU / VRAM",
      "pos": [
        750,
        65
      ],
      "size": [
        920,
        270
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 32,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "After installing the separate Prophetero monitor, the bottom-right panel shows elapsed time, estimated time remaining, CPU, GPU, VRAM, and RAM.\n\nHardware readings come from Crystools. If blank: ComfyUI Settings → Crystools → enable CPU Usage and GPU VRAM; set Refresh per second to 0.5.\n\nThese are live system readings and are not added to the image or video."
      ],
      "color": "#214355",
      "bgcolor": "#172b35"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "PREVIEW · TIME · ETA",
      "pos": [
        1720,
        65
      ],
      "size": [
        1040,
        270
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 33,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "The Model Preview Override in group 04 shows a partial video while generating.\n\nIts header shows current/total steps, average step time, and ETA. ETA estimates the current sampling stage only; decoding and saving may take longer.\n\nWith the Prophetero panel installed, elapsed time is visible during the run. Crystools shows total runtime after completion."
      ],
      "color": "#214355",
      "bgcolor": "#172b35"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "QUICK START · OUTPUT",
      "pos": [
        2810,
        65
      ],
      "size": [
        1050,
        270
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 34,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set the start image, scene prompt, duration, FPS, and resolution.\n2. Enable only the LoRAs you need in Power LoRA Loader.\n3. End and middle images are OFF by default; enable them only when needed.\n4. The finished video appears in SaveVideo; prefix: video/H3_Eros_Max_Pro_I2V.\n\nThere is no exact ETA for the full run. Preview estimates can change as it proceeds."
      ],
      "color": "#214355",
      "bgcolor": "#172b35"
    }
